<title>FRANCE: Eurotunnel share should requote Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel share should requote Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>A spokeswoman for Channel Tunnel operator Eurotunnel SA/Plc said on Thursday its shares should be requoted in Paris and London next Tuesday morning, subject to the approval of the stock market authorities.</p>
<p>A source close to the company's debt restructuring talks had said on Wednesday the stock should requote by Tuesday at the latest.</p>
</text>
